                <td>Zero floor space (wall mounted)</td>
                <td>Large floor footprint</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td><strong>Recirculation Compatibility</strong></td>
                <td>Limited by tank volume</td>
                <td>Built-in intelligent pump</td>
                <td>Requires external timer pump</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
